{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21981","headline":"浔阳三题 庐山桂 · 白居易","name":"浔阳三题 庐山桂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偃蹇月中桂，结根依青天。\n天风绕月起，吹子下人间。\n飘零委何处，乃落匡庐山。\n生爲石上桂，叶如翦碧鲜。\n枝干日长大，根荄日牢坚。\n不归天上月，空老山中年。\n庐山去咸阳，道里三四千。\n无人爲移植，得入上林园。\n不及红花树，长栽温室前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21981.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21981","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}